bench.toml"," or ",[256,416,417],{},"sites\u002F",". Reads Press and Pilot layouts, and turns their deploy and migrate tasks into deployment markers.",[358,420,421,426],{},[204,422,423],{"v-slot:title":206},[213,424,425],{},"What it catches",[204,427,428,441,454,467,480,493],{"v-slot:features":206},[368,429,431,436],{"icon":430,"to":102},"i-lucide-server-crash",[204,432,433],{"v-slot:title":206},[213,434,435],{},"5xx and 502 windows",[204,437,438],{"v-slot:description":206},[213,439,440],{},"Per site and per route, from the nginx access log. Tied to the deployment that preceded them.",[368,442,444,449],{"icon":443,"to":102},"i-lucide-alarm-clock-off",[204,445,446],{"v-slot:title":206},[213,447,448],{},"Failed crons at 2AM",[204,450,451],{"v-slot:description":206},[213,452,453],{},"Failed scheduled jobs, a stalled scheduler, failed backups and RQ backlogs, before the morning shift.",[368,455,457,462],{"icon":456,"to":61},"i-lucide-cpu",[204,458,459],{"v-slot:title":206},[213,460,461],{},"Workers and hosts",[204,463,464],{"v-slot:description":206},[213,465,466],{},"Worker crashes, OOM kills, processes down, CPU, memory, disk, load, TLS expiry and database replication.",[368,468,470,475],{"icon":469,"to":122},"i-lucide-shield-alert",[204,471,472],{"v-slot:title":206},[213,473,474],{},"Suspicious access",[204,476,477],{"v-slot:description":206},[213,478,479],{},"SSH brute force, admin logins from a new IP or country, web attack scans, privileged role grants and risky Server Scripts.",[368,481,483,488],{"icon":482,"to":112},"i-lucide-git-merge",[204,484,485],{"v-slot:title":206},[213,486,487],{},"One incident, not fifty emails",[204,489,490],{"v-slot:description":206},[213,491,492],{},"Events are grouped per site, bench or host. Channels hear about it when it opens, reopens and resolves.",[368,494,496,501],{"icon":495,"to":107},"i-lucide-bell-ring",[204,497,498],{"v-slot:title":206},[213,499,500],{},"Ten channels",[204,502,503],{"v-slot:description":206},[213,504,505],{}